---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "Food Brand Package | Trademark, FSSAI & Udyam Bundle";
const description = "All-in-one regulatory and brand protection package for food manufacturers, cloud kitchens, and packaged goods brands in India with BRNDNUR Advisory LLP.";
const canonical = "https://brndnur.com/packages/food-brand/";
---

<BaseLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  canonical={canonical}
  currentPath="/packages/food-brand/"
>
  <main id="main-content">
    <!-- Breadcrumb & Hero -->
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <nav class="bn-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
          <a href="/">Home</a>
          <span class="sep">/</span>
          <a href="/packages/">Packages</a>
          <span class="sep">/</span>
          <span class="current">Food Brand Package</span>
        </nav>
        <p class="eyebrow">Industry-Specific Bundle</p>
        <h1>Food Brand Package.</h1>
        <p class="lead">A complete, integrated package designed for restaurants, packaged food producers, bakeries, cloud kitchens, and culinary entrepreneurs. Unites trademark protection with mandatory food safety and MSME registrations.</p>
        
        <div class="hero-badges">
          <div class="hero-badge-item">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
            <span>Trademark + FSSAI + Udyam Bundle</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-badge-item">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23"/><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
            <span>Indicative Professional Fee: From ₹12,000</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-badge-item">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
            <span>FoSCoS Portal & Class 29/30/43 Setup</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="actions" style="margin-top: 28px;">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://wa.me/919048188899?text=Hello%20BRNDNUR%2C%20I%20am%20interested%20in%20the%20Food%20Brand%20Package." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Inquire About Food Package &rarr;</a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/packages/">All Packages</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Split Visual Section -->
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="split-row">
          <div class="split-photo">
            <img src="/packages/assets/food-brand-package.webp" alt="BRNDNUR Food Brand Package bundling Trademark, FSSAI and MSME in Kerala" width="800" height="600" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="split-copy">
            <p class="eyebrow">Culinary Compliance</p>
            <h2>Unified Brand Defense and Food Safety Licensing</h2>
            <p>Kerala is renowned for exceptional culinary entrepreneurship—from traditional spices, banana chips, and bakery creations to contemporary specialty cafes and cloud kitchens. Yet launching a food brand requires navigating multiple regulatory authorities simultaneously.</p>
            <p>Our Food Brand Package eliminates administrative fragmentation by synchronizing your trademark filing (Classes 29, 30, or 43), mandatory FSSAI food business licensing on FoSCoS, and Udyam MSME certification under a single coordinated workflow.</p>
            <div class="advisory-notice" style="margin-top: 16px;">
              <div class="advisory-notice-icon">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="advisory-notice-content">
                <h4>FSSAI Tiering Notice</h4>
                <p>Statutory fees depend on your operation scale: Basic FSSAI Registration (turnover up to ₹12 lakhs) carries a nominal government fee, whereas State Licenses (turnover ₹12L–₹20Cr) require higher statutory dues. We verify your turnover tier before submitting.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 3 Core Inclusions with Clean SVGs -->
    <section class="section section-alt">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading text-center">
          <p class="eyebrow">Comprehensive Inclusions</p>
          <h2>Three Essential Pillars for Food Businesses</h2>
          <p>Launching a food enterprise requires brand exclusivity combined with strict statutory licensing:</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-grid">
          <div class="bn-card">
            <div class="card-icon" style="color: #A8781A;">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Food Trademark Filing</h3>
            <p>Pre-filing name clearance, class identification (Class 29, 30, 31, 32, or 43 as applicable), and application filing on Form TM-A with official receipt.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bn-card">
            <div class="card-icon" style="color: #A8781A;">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M18 8h1a4 4 0 0 1 0 8h-1"/><path d="M2 8h16v9a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H6a4 4 0 0 1-4-4V8z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>FSSAI License / Registration</h3>
            <p>Document preparation, FoSCoS portal application assembly, layout plan review, and guidance securing your mandatory 14-digit FSSAI license number.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bn-card">
            <div class="card-icon" style="color: #A8781A;">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"/><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"/><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Udyam / MSME Certificate</h3>
            <p>Registration as a certified MSME, qualifying your enterprise for priority lending and the 50% statutory trademark fee concession.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Bundle Matrix Table -->
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading text-center">
          <p class="eyebrow">Bundle Specifications</p>
          <h2>Food Brand Package Component Breakdown</h2>
          <p>Full breakdown of deliverables, statutory jurisdictions, and pricing structure.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bn-table-wrap">
          <table class="bn-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Pillar</th>
                <th>Deliverables Included</th>
                <th>Government Authority</th>
                <th>Fee Structure</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Trademark Protection</strong></td>
                <td>Search, class mapping (Cl 29/30/43), Form TM-A filing & receipt</td>
                <td>Trade Marks Registry (CGPDTM)</td>
                <td>₹4,500 statutory fee (with MSME) + professional fee</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Food Safety Licensing</strong></td>
                <td>FoSCoS portal submission, premises declaration, FSSAI number</td>
                <td>FSSAI (Food Safety and Standards Authority)</td>
                <td>Statutory fee based on tier (Basic vs State) + professional fee</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>MSME Enterprise Status</strong></td>
                <td>Udyam registration certificate, priority sector eligibility</td>
                <td>Ministry of MSME</td>
                <td>Included in package advisory scope</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Complete Bundle Scope</strong></td>
                <td>All 3 pillars coordinated simultaneously under one dedicated advisor</td>
                <td>Integrated Filing</td>
                <td><strong>From ₹12,000 professional fee</strong> + actual statutory fees</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Call to Action -->
    <section class="cta-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cta-panel">
          <p class="eyebrow">Launch Compliantly</p>
          <h2>Operating a Food or Beverage Enterprise?</h2>
          <p>Connect with our team to verify your food categories, calculate exact statutory fees, and begin your applications.</p>
          <div class="cta-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-gold" href="https://wa.me/919048188899?text=Hello%20BRNDNUR%2C%20please%20confirm%20the%20Food%20Brand%20Package%20scope%20and%20current%20price." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Confirm Food Package Quote &rarr;</a>
            <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/packages/gulf-return-business/">Gulf-Return Package</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
